@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

note over S, B: startFSM() -> transitionTo(SetUpState)

== SetUpState Entry ==

note over S: BaseState.onEntry(): notifyPhaseObservers(SETUP) BEFORE onEntryActions()\n(typically no BuildingEffects are active at setup)
loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver) — typically none at setup
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
end

note over S: onEntryActions():\ninitializeBoard()\nrandomizeInitialTurnOrder() (assigns initial food — no notification)\ncompletedRounds = 1\nbuildSnapshot()

S ->> B: notifyGameSetupCompleted(totemByPlayer: Map<String,Totem>, turnOrder: List<String>, initialFood: Map<String,Integer>, boardSnapshot: BoardSnapshot)

== Transition to TotemPlacementState ==

note over S: transitionTo(TotemPlacementState)\nonEntry(): notifyPhaseObservers(TOTEM_PLACEMENT) BEFORE onEntryActions()
loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
end

S ->> B: notifyPhaseChanged(phase: TOTEM_PLACEMENT, currentPlayer: String, resolutionOrder: null)

note right S: No notifyPhaseChanged(SETUP) is ever emitted.\nSee TotemPlacementState diagram (C).

@enduml